      "id": "blk_9f35d2e0",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "如同那不盖勒二世所享有的美誉,蓝衣「芬莱克」理应拥有的称呼。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_66192ad3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "但不知为何,芬莱克生前始终禁止教士们如此称呼他,直至他葬身海底。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_11ba298f",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "而在隐海修会的历史上,芬莱克仅此一位。",
